# ---- Runtime state (regenerated: `enterprise-rag seed` + `enterprise-rag ingest`) ----
# The corpus itself IS committed: it is synthetic, reviewable, and lets a clone run
# immediately. Everything below is machine-local state.
# Note: .gitignore has no inline comments, so keep explanations on their own lines.
data/chroma/
data/audit/
data/eval_reports/
# contains PBKDF2 password hashes for the demo directory
data/users.json
# derived from the corpus at ingest time
data/catalog.json
# cached embedding vectors for the hashing backend
data/embedding_cache.json
*.egg-info/

